swerCount\":1,\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"The pixel limit ensures the meta description isn\u2019t cut off in search results. So, staying within the limit avoids truncation, improving visibility and click-through rates by providing users with a clear summary.\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/meta-title-description-length\/#faq-question-1739980880246\",\"position\":10,\"url\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/meta-title-description-length\/#faq-question-1739980880246\",\"name\":\"Does meta title length affect SEO rankings?\",\"answerCount\":1,\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"No, the length of a meta title doesn't directly impact SEO rankings, but a concise and relevant title can improve click-through rates, which can benefit SEO.\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/meta-title-description-length\/#faq-question-1739980896270\",\"position\":11,\"url\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/meta-title-description-length\/#faq-question-1739980896270\",\"name\":\"How can I check if my meta title is within the limit?\",\"answerCount\":1,\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Use tools like Yoast SEO, Rank Math, or free online tools to check and verify your meta title length.\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/meta-title-description-length\/#faq-question-1739980909640\",\"position\":12,\"url\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/meta-title-description-length\/#faq-question-1739980909640\",\"name\":\"Is it okay to have duplicate meta titles?\",\"answerCount\":1,\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Duplicate meta titles can harm your SEO, so it\u2019s essential to write a unique, descriptive title for each page.\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},